*
BV 0 V i=vfactor*idt( 0, idt( i(Gvolt)**2,0,v(res) ) / v(per), v(clk) )**0.5 + vfactor*idt( 0, idt( i(Gvolt)**2,0,v(_res) ) / v(_per), v(_clk) )**0.5 tripdt={tripdt} tripdv={tripdv} rpar={att/2}
.ends


