* 1 phase RMS ampere meter
* tenable because sometimes the first timesteps
* in the simulation makes large spikes
* e.g. setting err0=1 in the generator models
* default=1us

.subckt ameter_RMS vin vout I
+ params: fc=3 tdv=1 tdt=1 tenable=1u
Vamper vin vout 0
Eamper I1 0 VALUE={IF(time>tenable,I(Vamper),0)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
XU4 I1 I RMS fc={fc} b0=1 b1=3
.ends

