* 50Hz lowpass cutoff=50Hz 
* Shunt first,order2,Butterworth,Lowpass,100kohm outputimpedance,comp. values exact
* coupled device (connected to input) therefore
* this device is used e.g. at the output of a Rectifiercircuit
* for a example see:
* ..\ltspice\loadflow_transient_examples\OtherTestingModelling\Three_Phase_Rectifier\ThreePhaseRectifier3.asc
* E1=disabled, R1 from 1000 to 1e6, L2*1e6/1000,C1*1000/1e6
.subckt 50Hz_lp in out params: tenable=1u
* Butterworth filter
E1 in1 0 VALUE={IF(time>tenable,v(in),0)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
L2 in1 out 2251H
C1 in1 0 4.502nF
R1 out 0 1e6
.ends

* Bandstop
* 45-55Hz
.subckt 50Hz in out params: tenable=1u
* Butterworth filter
E1 in1 0 VALUE={IF(time>tenable,v(in),0)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
L1 in1 out 909.4mH
C1 in1 out 11.25uF
L2 out L1rms2 22.51H
C2 L1rms2 0 454.7n
R1 out 0 1000ohm
.ends

* 55-65Hz Bandstop
.subckt 60Hz in out params: tenable=1u
* Butterworth filter 2nd orger, Series first
E1 in1 0 VALUE={IF(time>tenable,v(in),0)} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
L1 in1 out 629.6mH
C1 in1 out 11.25uF
L2 out L1rms2 22.51H
C2 L1rms2 0 314.8n
R1 out 0 1000ohm
.ends


